+/*
+ * kgr_patcher -- just kick kgr infrastructure for test
+ *
+ *  Copyright (c) 2013-2014 SUSE
+ *   Authors: Jiri Kosina
+ *	      Vojtech Pavlik
+ *	      Jiri Slaby
+ */
+
